<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Leap Skill</h1>
<p>Class and level:
</p>
<pre> Barbarian Level 15
</pre>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> leap &lt;direction&gt;
</pre>
<p>A demonstration of the incredible fitness of the barbarian warrior, 
they have the ability to leap from one area to another, even while 
engaged in combat. By leaping a certain direction, if successful 
the barbarian will move from one room to another adjacent room. If 
this skill is executed during combat, the fight will come to an end 
as the Barbarian departs the scene.
</p><p>A leap takes 50 endurance, also when it fails, so you need more than 
that to try. You can't leap through a closed door, out onto water 
that needs a boat, or out of a place whose magic keeps you in.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre> &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Barbarian</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fleeing</a>
</pre>




</div>